\label{lemma-normal-integral-sections}
\begin{slogan}
The ring of functions on a normal scheme is normal.
\end{slogan}
Let $X$ be an integral normal scheme.
Then $\Gamma(X, \mathcal{O}_X)$ is a normal domain.
